  speakerName: Kalaw
  speakerPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e9a1f2822809deb49a0ce098da0fddca, type: 3}
  dialogueText: "Apo Lakay binati naka iti Ilokano. Naimbag a bigat ket kasla \u2018Good
    morning.\u2019 No ammo dagiti sao da, nalaklaka nga aginnawat ti lugar kenka."
  translatedText: "Apo Lakay greeted you in Ilokano. Naimbag a bigat is like saying
    \u2018Good morning.\u2019 When you understand their words, the place becomes
    more welcoming."
